Item 5. Other Information
Security Trading Plans of Directors and Executive Officers
On September 6, 2024, John David Rainey, Executive Vice President and Chief Financial Officer, entered into a stock trading plan designed to comply with Rule 10b5-1 under the Securities Exchange Act of 1934. Under the terms of the plan, Mr. Rainey may sell an aggregate 95,800 shares of common stock. The plan will terminate on December 1, 2025. Mr. Rainey's existing Rule 10b5-1 plan, which was entered into on March 24, 2023, expires when the last trade is executed on December 2, 2024.
